    (0x002E67C0, 'func', 'Area_BuildPeople', 'fills g_AreaPeople for the current area from g_PeoplePlacement: the base layer (0), a time/state layer (0-3), the story-stage layer (g_StageLayer), mission layers; then counts the people into g_AreaPeopleCount. Called by Area_Load'),
