    (0x002E7A50, 'func', 'Location_Current', '-> 0x006CBB04, the area id Area_ChangeTo last sent the player to (the one Area_Load loads; same numbering as Area_Current, g_AreaDefs index). Its name is AreaDef.name_text, NOT text 18000 + id (area 5 = ABANDONED SUBWAY STATION = text 18002; docs/STAGES.md)'),
    (0x002E9590, 'func', 'Options_SetMode', '(0 = title screen, 1 = pause menu) -> gp-20216, picks byte +26 or +27 of each option record'),
    (0x002EC560, 'func', 'Fighter_AttackCollide', '(fighter, other) sends the attack spheres (g_AttackSpheres, radius x 2) whose bit is in +0x44F0, only while +0x44F4 <= motion frame (+0x2D4) <= +0x44F6; damage from g_ActionHits[+0x4348][+0x4570]'),
    (0x002F0900, 'func', 'Fighter_PlayMotion', '(fighter, anim id, start frame, end frame or -1, blend frames); motion id at +0x3FA4'),
    (0x002F1610, 'func', 'Fighter_UpdateMotion', 'advances the motion by frame time x speed (+0x3FE8, x1.2 when 0x0060C960 bit 0), blends from the previous motion over +0x3FA8 seconds, copies bone positions to +0x35C'),
    (0x002F4BF0, 'func', 'Fighter_AttachPart', "(item, fighter, part slot, clump, ?) puts an outfit item's clump on the fighter: category 0 (body) becomes the fighter's main clump with the skeleton (HAnim hierarchy); any other item is hung on body skeleton node ItemDef.attach_node (part slot +0x5F0 = hierarchy nodeInfo[node].frame); category 7 (left shoe) also calls 0x002FA9F0"),
    (0x002F52C0, 'func', 'Fighter_UsesPresetModel', "(fighter) 1 if the fighter's outfit slots equal its preset's, so the fight model is the prebuilt ARCHIVE.XAF entry = preset number; always 0 for persons 51 and 52 (the cut character editor's slots), whose model is built from the slots"),
    (0x002F53A0, 'func', 'Fighter_LoadModel', "(phase, slot, flags) loads a fighter's fight model: the prebuilt ARCHIVE.XAF entry of its preset, or (persons 51/52, changed outfits) head pieces from ARCHIVE.XAF combinations, clothes as ARCHIVE.XAF item + 0x3A6, textures from DATA.XAF by the slots' part ids; state in 0x005FFD48 (0x17 = done)"),
