    (0x003510B0, 'func', 'Doors_CollectAtomic', "RpClumpForAllAtomics callback: the atomic on a frame under the hierarchy root is a door's zone (+0), the one on its child frame the panel (+4); the frame's BONETAG goes to +0x54 (destination area; negative tags -(area x 10 + entrance) are split into +0x54 area, +0x58 entrance), raw tag at +0x56"),
    (0x00351230, 'func', 'Doors_Load', '(collision + 0x70, doors clump, doors animation) reads the doors clump (section 5) and its HAnim animation (section 6) and collects up to 9 doors with Doors_CollectAtomic'),
    (0x003515A0, 'func', 'Door_State', "(door index) looks the door's raw tag up in g_AreaDoorFlags: story flag first_flag + index set -> 0 (and +0x50 = 0x00351280(flag)); else 0 if the destination is in the area's allowed list (or the special 0x30/0x33 pair), else 1. Meaning of 0/1 (locked/open) not confirmed"),
